/T (While reduced during the Justice Reform Initiative \(JRI\) in 2016 and the Covid-19 pandemic in 2020, Utah's prison population has experienced upward pressure in the past 14 years. Between 2010 and 2024, the population increased by a median* annual value of 1.5%. This value was higher when excluding JRI and Covid-19 \(2.2%\). )
/E (While reduced during the Justice Reform Initiative \(JRI\) in 2016 and the Covid-19 pandemic in 2020, Utah's prison population has experienced upward pressure in the past 14 years. Between 2010 and 2024, the population increased by a median* annual value of 1.5%. This value was higher when excluding JRI and Covid-19 \(2.2%\). )
/Alt ()
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
